[36m(TaskRunner pid=150529)[0m ### Step 4: Smith’s Theorem (Key Insight)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=150529)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=150529)[0m From number theory, **if a number ends with 1**, it is **coprime with 10**, i.e., it is **not divisible by 2 or 5**.
